    "code": " # This is simple recurrence that we had learnt that is\n\n# let S(n) be the number of bills for getting the money out\n\n# then recurrence is\n\n# s(n)=1+min(S(n-1),S(n-5),S(n-10),S(n-20),S(n-100))\n\n# memoization \n\n# lst conatins list where for each index we have its min bill stores\n\n\n\n#  we do this problem iterative\n\nimport sys \n\n\n\ndef hitLotery(n):\n\n<0x09>lst=[-1 for i in range (n+1)]\n\n<0x09># base case\n\n<0x09>lst[0]=0\n\n<0x09>i=1\n\n<0x09>while(i<len(lst)):\n\n<0x09><0x09># induction hypothesis\n\n<0x09><0x09>\n\n<0x09><0x09>b1=lst[i-1]\n\n<0x09><0x09>if(i-5>=0):\n\n<0x09><0x09><0x09>b2=lst[i-5]\n\n<0x09><0x09>else:\n\n<0x09><0x09><0x09>b2=sys.maxsize \n\n\n\n<0x09><0x09>if(i-10>=0):\n\n<0x09><0x09><0x09>b3=lst[i-10]\n\n<0x09><0x09>else:\n\n<0x09><0x09><0x09>b3=sys.maxsize \n\n<0x09><0x09>if(i-20>=0):\n\n<0x09><0x09><0x09>b4=lst[i-20]\n\n<0x09><0x09>else:\n\n<0x09><0x09><0x09>b4=sys.maxsize \n\n<0x09><0x09>if(i-100>=0):\n\n<0x09><0x09><0x09>b5=lst[i-100]\n\n<0x09><0x09>else:\n\n<0x09><0x09><0x09>b5=sys.maxsize \n\n\n\n\n\n<0x09><0x09># now we have got the previous valuies thus \n\n<0x09><0x09># induction step\n\n<0x09><0x09>lst[i]=1+min(b1,b2,b3,b4,b5)\n\n<0x09><0x09>i=i+1 \n\n\n\n<0x09>return(lst[n])\n\n\n\nn=int(input())\n\nprint(hitLotery(n))",
